\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8220\'93I can\u8217\'92t.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8220\'93Vigram,\u8221\'94 Lora said sharply. \u8220\'93Let. It. Go.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Mandri wondered what kind of niece would first-name her uncle like that. Order him around? What kind of Vigram could console his rage with a frustrated headshake?}
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0  She squeezed Mandri\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92s scrawny shoulders as she hid herself behind him, pressing herself against him in genuine fright.}
